<title>USA: Audiovox forms Audiovox Communications.</title>
<headline>Audiovox forms Audiovox Communications.</headline>
<dateline>HAPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audiovox Corp said on Monday it formed a wholly owned subsidiary, Audiovox Communications Corp, from its former cellular division.</p>
<p>It said the unit would focus on increasing its existing cellular business while pursuing new growth strategies in the wireless communications industry.</p>
<p>Philip Christopher, executive vice president of Audiovox, will be president and chief executive of Audiovox Communications Corp and John Shalam, chairman, president and CEO of Audiovox, will be chairman of Audiovox Communications, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
